<title>USA: Exporters sell 150,000 tonnes soybeans to unknown.</title>
<headline>Exporters sell 150,000 tonnes soybeans to unknown.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exporters reported the sale of 150,000 tonnes of U.S. soybeans to unknown destinations for 1997/98 delivery.</p>
<p>The 1997/98 marketing year will open Sept 1.</p>
<p>By law, exporters are required to promptly report the sale of 100,000 tonnes or more of a commodity. It can take a few days for identity of a buyer to become known.</p>
